OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry urges miners to share
OL,4,AOrgreave stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the inquiry panel
OL,7,Finvestigating the infamous Battle of
OL,8,FOrgreave, which saw police and striking
OL,9,Fminers clash in 1984, has urged the
OL,10,Fworkers who were there to share their
OL,11,Fstories at an event later this week.
OL,13,FAbout 5,000 miners and 6,000 police
OL,14,Fofficers were at the Orgreave coking
OL,15,Fplant in South Yorkshire on 18 June
OL,16,Fthat year.
OL,18,FMany miners were injured in clashes
OL,19,Fbroadcast to the nation on news
OL,20,Fbulletins but, despite 95 arrests, no
OL,21,Fprosecutions resulted.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
