OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry urges miners to share
OL,4,AOrgreave stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrgreave Inquiry member Baroness Mary
OL,7,FBousted said significant numbers of
OL,8,FCounty Durham miners travelled to
OL,9,Fpicket the plant and she urged them to
OL,10,Fshare their experiences at a listening
OL,11,Fevent at Redhills Durham Miners Hall on
OL,12,FThursday.
